# check_disk_instability with BulgeSizeOn 3 on a real R1 central near its Toomre threshold
# with ColdGas and MetalsColdGas raised by 25% (a plausible call-time inflow), as the R0
# central fixtures do: gas-unstable.
# galaxy 0: R1 reference /Volumes/Internal/results/sage26-campaign/workspace/e01-reference/out/R1/model_0.hdf5 (SHA-256 870acea288250919624ae8a4b984a4dde7106e6355cdb972cf4880ff04635ca0), Snap_32 row 159 (GalaxyIndex 1000000054, Type 0).
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time
# state (the writer stores these fields verbatim). Constructed: ColdGas and MetalsColdGas
# (1.25 times the output values), OutflowRate 0 (its value at substep 0 after the
# first-occupied reset, R/src/core_build_model.c:276) and zero histories, as at substep 0;
# call.time, call.dt and call.step_bin are the R0 template's plausible values.
# Reachability: R1-reachable.
